---
// "Who I am" section.
---
<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-card">

    <!-- Photo LEFT -->
    <div class="about-img-wrap">
      <img src="/New Profile.jpg" alt="Eliya Kapach" />
    </div>

    <!-- Text RIGHT -->
    <div class="about-text">
      <h3 class="about-heading">Behind the Lens</h3>
      <p class="about-intro">I'm Eliya, a filmmaker drawn to places, people, and the stories that connect them.</p>
      <p>
        My work moves between commercial projects, travel, and personal filmmaking — always guided
        by the same intention: to create films that feel as meaningful as they look.
      </p>
      <p class="highlight">I believe the most powerful images don't just show us something. They make us feel something.</p>

      <div class="skills-wrap">
        <p class="skills-label">What I do</p>
        <div class="skills-tags">
          <span class="skill-tag">Direction</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Cinematography</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Color Grading</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Editing</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Storytelling</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Sound Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
